## About our services

We cover a range of work for heavy-duty vehicles: DOT inspections, preventative
maintenance, battery service, wheel alignment, heavy equipment repair, welding
and fabrication, trailer repair and more. Wheel alignment and suspension are the
specialty; the rest of the list is what a shop with seven bays and a heavy-duty
rack can genuinely do well.

Welding and fabrication covers frame repair, structural modification and custom
metal work on trucks and trailers, in steel and aluminum. RV work is tire and
alignment service — the two things that decide whether an RV handles safely and
wears its tires evenly.

Call {% phone /%} to talk about a job that is not on the list. Most of them we
have done before.

